#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"An example of the use of various POSIX semaphore functions is shown in "
"B<sem_wait>(3)."
msgstr "Пример использования функций семафоров POSIX показан в B<sem_wait>(3)."

